+Formal Artifacts & How to Reproduce (for reviewers)
+
+Contents of the formal package:
+- expanded_controller_spec.tla : TLA+ spec including human presence, watchdog and command bounds
+- apalache.out : Apalache run output (if Apalache available)
+- any previous TLA+/proof artifacts in ops/formal/
+- evidence manifest recorded via ops/sdk/evidence_sdk (links to audit bundles)
+
+How to reproduce locally:
+1) Install Apalache: follow https://apalache.informal.systems/docs/installation
+2) Run:
+   apalache-mc check expanded_controller_spec.tla
+3) Inspect apalache.out for counterexamples or violations.
+
+What reviewers should verify:
+- The spec models human presence and safety envelope appropriately.
+- The invariants (command bounds, safe-mode behavior) capture safety requirements from HARA.
+- Any counterexamples are analyzed and addressed by control engineers; acceptance criteria documented.
+- Evidence manifests in the bundle show the version of code / controller used for the model.
+
+Contact the formal-team for clarifications and to request additional traces or model elaborations.
